					<reportElement x="5" y="7" width="514" height="474" uuid="82a0c280-47f6-46e8-bb77-5f9e7659bcc5"/>
					<text><![CDATA[Dear Sir / Madam 
 
This is not a request for payment, but only a request to confirm your balance with us as on  

If you already paid any amount/s after that date it might not be included in the balance shown hereunder. Please check the balance and acknowledge this letter and return the confirmation to our representative or fax it directly on our fax number 02-6567844. Also you can Email it to

Your co-operation with this regard will be a highly appreciated in order to update our records and adjust differences, if any. In case your book of accounts shows a different balance, kindly attach the statement of account with the details of your balance. 
Your balance as per our books is AED   
Thanking you, we appreciate your business. 
Yours faithfully

 For: TAJEER LEASING LLC


 
 
 
 
Mohammad Al Darabseh Manager, 
Credit Control - Finance
 Al Fahim Group - Head Office  
---------------------------------------------
 
 To: TAJEER LEASING LLC 		  	   From: 

			             



Signature & Seal : ------------------------------------------------------

Name  :---------------------------------------------------------
Title     :---------------------------------------------------------

Date: ----/----/---- ]]></text>
